ref="http://subscribe.getmiro.com/?url1=http%3A//www.the-gamery.com/category/podcast/feed&trackback1=http%3A//www.miroguide.com/feeds/17473/subscribe-hit&section1=video" title="Subscribe to The Gamery on Miro"><img src="http://subscribe.getmiro.com/img/buttons/patrace1.png" alt="Miro Podcast Directory" border="0" style="padding-left:20px;vertical-align:middle;" /></a> </div>
